{"1396870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ENCHAIN", "steam_appid": 1396870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ENCHAIN links hack &amp; slash juggling and frenetic platforming with fast-paced retro FPS gunplay. Inspired by platform fighters and arena shooters, smash the undead into pieces with exhilarating velocity. And, with progression and verticality influenced by Dark Souls, tackle a single interconnected world chunk by chunk, retreading old paths and checkpoints with newfound technique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1396870/extras/e036e756a4aebc347519850a10a6852c.avif?t=1781631090\" width=960 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last corpse to ever rise from the petrified earth, dooming all creation to a ceaseless death. This underworld does not welcome you. Unlock the secrets of the crypt, take back life from your fleshless kindred, and fight your own way out of humanity's tomb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get lost in the chasm. No one will be holding your cold, hollow hands along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grapple, slide, kick, wall-run, and dive into dynamic expressive platforming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment to learn a full suite of movement techniques, and use them to your advantage to rise above the crypt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect powerful weapons and bracelets, each with their own quirks and synergies to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel twisting routes in an intertwined, non-linear underworld that whispers its forgotten history across scattered item inscriptions.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ENCHAIN links hack &amp; slash juggling and frenetic platforming with fast-paced retro FPS gunplay. Inspired by platform fighters and arena shooters, smash the undead into pieces with exhilarating velocity. And, with progression and verticality influenced by Dark Souls, tackle a single interconnected world chunk by chunk, retreading old paths and checkpoints with newfound technique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1396870/extras/e036e756a4aebc347519850a10a6852c.avif?t=1781631090\" width=960 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last corpse to ever rise from the petrified earth, dooming all creation to a ceaseless death. This underworld does not welcome you. Unlock the secrets of the crypt, take back life from your fleshless kindred, and fight your own way out of humanity's tomb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get lost in the chasm. No one will be holding your cold, hollow hands along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grapple, slide, kick, wall-run, and dive into dynamic expressive platforming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment to learn a full suite of movement techniques, and use them to your advantage to rise above the crypt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect powerful weapons and bracelets, each with their own quirks and synergies to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel twisting routes in an intertwined, non-linear underworld that whispers its forgotten history across scattered item inscriptions.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Grapple, throw, and break your fellow undead in this bone-smashing exploration movement shooter. Challenge the afterlife, collect secret artifacts, and uncover the deprived depths as you clamber out of a hopeless abyss.", "supported_language